---
// pixelarrow.app: the "Play your way" page (mockup D, shots/landing/proto/LAND_desktop_D_1.png; phone
// LAND_phone_1.png). Every claim is in docs/WAR.md. Clips come from public/video/ (components/Clip.astro).
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Chapter from '../components/sections/Chapter.astro';
import Closing from '../components/sections/Closing.astro';
import Hero from '../components/sections/Hero.astro';
import Men from '../components/sections/Men.astro';
import World from '../components/sections/World.astro';
---
<Base>
  <Hero />
  <Chapter id="trader" title="The Trader" side="left" clips={['war-caravan']} fallback="/art/trade-road.webp" label="A merchant's ox cart rolls down a road between hoplite escorts.">
    Lead caravans between market towns, trading copper, tin and salt. Tin is scarce, so every cart is worth a raid.
  </Chapter>
  <Chapter id="builder" title="The Builder" side="right" clips={['war-build']} fallback="/art/keyart-battle.webp" label="Workers raise stone walls and towers to fortify a region.">
    Build forts, walls, towers and bridges to secure your land.
  </Chapter>
  <Chapter id="warlord" title="The Warlord" side="left" clips={['war-siege', 'war-battle']} fallback="/art/keyart-battle.webp" label="Two armies meet in battle below a fortress.">
    Lead your own men, up to 12 of them, in battles where as many as 600 soldiers fight for one region.
  </Chapter>
  <Chapter id="boss-hunter" title="The Boss Hunter" side="right" clips={['war-boss']} fallback="/art/keyart-drakon.webp" label="A white dragon breathes fire over a snowbound citadel as soldiers storm its walls.">
    Slay mythic bosses guarding ancient landmarks, from a cyclops at the mountain gate to the dragon Drakon on his glacier citadel.
  </Chapter>
  <Men />
  <World />
  <Closing />
</Base>
